WEBVTT

00:02.040 --> 00:08.510
<i>Causes of death are many and varied. 
Old age, suicide, illness...</i>

00:08.510 --> 00:13.230
<i>But the cause of death that scares the 
most people in this day and age...</i>

00:16.900 --> 00:18.200
<i>...is death by fire.</i>

00:44.070 --> 00:45.190
Take that!

02:30.080 --> 02:33.960
<b>Fire Force</b>

02:30.370 --> 02:33.960
<b>Chapter 3</b>

02:47.020 --> 02:50.020
<b>Episode 6
"Beyond Prayer's End"</b>

03:12.510 --> 03:15.770
That child's ability to concentrate 
on prayer is incredible.

03:26.430 --> 03:32.710
Your baptismal name shall be Leonard,
the lion who dispels evil.

03:33.610 --> 03:37.790
Engrave that way of life 
into your very being.

03:38.990 --> 03:40.900
I am honored.

03:41.420 --> 03:42.460
Látom.

03:44.900 --> 03:48.590
Are you still praying, Leonard Burns?

03:49.780 --> 03:54.130
Even though you carry a distrust of 
this empire, this world, within you?

03:54.510 --> 03:58.220
You're certainly working hard.
I'm impressed.

03:58.690 --> 04:02.950
We both exchanged one eye for a glimpse 
of the dissonance in this world.

04:02.950 --> 04:04.930
Why would you pray after that?

04:04.930 --> 04:09.000
To whom? For what? And to what purpose?

04:09.380 --> 04:12.480
Did your remaining eye get crushed?

04:12.480 --> 04:13.850
Wake up already.

04:19.170 --> 04:22.020
There you go again, not saying a word.

04:22.350 --> 04:26.110
There is no need to put 
my actions into words.

04:26.110 --> 04:28.910
I am a priest who serves God.

04:29.440 --> 04:30.740
No matter what may happen,

04:31.310 --> 04:33.680
I will continue to pray.

04:34.410 --> 04:39.850
Hey, Burns. You ever heard 
of the word "freedom"?

04:39.850 --> 04:43.570
You're one of Holy Sol's Shadows.
You have no freedom, so why speak of it?

04:44.580 --> 04:47.340
That's why I want to be free.

04:48.480 --> 04:51.300
If nothing else, I want to think freely.

04:51.830 --> 04:55.390
I have always believed in God.

04:55.980 --> 04:58.270
The form of my belief has not changed.

04:58.270 --> 05:00.490
Even if God isn't there?

05:00.490 --> 05:01.380
Even then.

05:01.740 --> 05:04.950
Isn't it suffocating, living that way?

05:08.460 --> 05:11.230
<i>If God is not there,</i>

05:11.230 --> 05:15.530
<i>then where do our prayers go?</i>

05:17.360 --> 05:20.080
<i>The diary of the wife of Raffles I...</i>

05:20.670 --> 05:23.760
<i>and the truth of the Holy Sol 
faith written within it.</i>

05:24.450 --> 05:29.260
<i>The founder of the Holy Sol faith was 
someone who had become a stranger to her.</i>

05:29.260 --> 05:30.430
<b>Holy Sol Temple</b>

05:33.680 --> 05:37.040
<i>But even if there was no God,</i>

05:37.040 --> 05:40.070
<i>the people were saved by the 
miracle known as Amaterasu.</i>

05:40.680 --> 05:45.580
<i>In that case, where was 
the God we believed in?</i>

05:46.890 --> 05:49.440
<i>What I saw in that moment was madness.</i>

05:49.870 --> 05:54.030
<i>I was touched by an overwhelming correct 
answer and an overwhelming insanity.</i>

05:54.780 --> 05:57.740
<i>That was the ultimate end 
of the people's ruin.</i>

05:58.360 --> 06:00.870
<i>What are my prayers?</i>

06:00.870 --> 06:03.440
<i>Why have I been praying?</i>

06:03.890 --> 06:06.660
<i>Was it for the salvation of 
my comrades, of the people?</i>

06:07.150 --> 06:08.660
<i>Who have I been praying to?</i>

06:09.310 --> 06:13.050
<i>For what? And to what purpose?</i>

06:14.720 --> 06:19.890
<i>No, my prayers have wanted for nothing.</i>

06:20.300 --> 06:23.800
<i>Pure, innocent prayer.
Praying itself was the objective.</i>

06:24.180 --> 06:28.400
<i>And now I have found it—
the destination of my prayers.</i>

06:28.400 --> 06:29.850
Did you give up?

06:32.490 --> 06:36.630
My prayers have wanted for 
nothing. In which case...

06:37.990 --> 06:41.120
I need only serve the end 
which lies beyond prayer.

06:43.040 --> 06:45.500
You're just a bumbling old guy 
causing problems for everyone.

06:45.730 --> 06:47.830
One day, you will all understand, too.

06:47.830 --> 06:50.140
I'm never giving up!

06:55.370 --> 06:57.030
I've already told you!

06:57.030 --> 07:00.140
If that's your intent, then show 
you can surpass me, young man!

07:45.460 --> 07:49.220
It will not be an old soldier like me 
who destroys order and discipline!

07:56.620 --> 07:57.950
You're still too far.

07:59.080 --> 08:00.500
Corna!

08:11.720 --> 08:13.880
Even old soldiers have their pride!

08:14.320 --> 08:16.600
If you're talking about pride, new soldiers...

08:16.600 --> 08:19.300
We new soldiers have it, too!

08:25.220 --> 08:29.260
If that's all you've got, you won't 
be able to change a single thing!

08:31.320 --> 08:34.140
I'm still... just getting started!

08:36.690 --> 08:40.070
A fight between the kid's 
pride and the old man's...

08:40.990 --> 08:47.220
This fight is never gonna end until 
the kid surpasses the old man.

08:57.770 --> 09:00.060
If you wanna take a spin with me that badly...

09:21.720 --> 09:26.910
He's a mass of energy. Is he planning to 
compel submission through brute force?

09:29.720 --> 09:31.550
I'm still not getting enough speed!

09:31.790 --> 09:34.750
Kinetic energy equals 
mass times acceleration.

09:34.750 --> 09:38.640
If I go fast enough, I'll never lose 
to anyone in a battle of strength!

09:40.600 --> 09:42.300
I've gotta go faster!

09:42.700 --> 09:44.060
Is this all...

09:45.760 --> 09:47.570
your strength of will amounts to?!

09:57.970 --> 10:02.160
<i>A dark hero like me won't be 
the one to change things.</i>

10:03.020 --> 10:04.620
<i>It'll be a real hero.</i>

10:07.200 --> 10:08.040
Shinra!

10:25.980 --> 10:27.850
<i>There's no time to rest!</i>

10:29.650 --> 10:31.270
<i>Go faster!</i>

10:32.810 --> 10:37.650
Just as you struggle in this fight,
you are merely struggling against the world!

10:37.650 --> 10:41.030
If you don't know what to do,
then struggling's all that's left!

10:41.030 --> 10:44.930
Or should young people just 
agree and obey without a fight?

10:44.930 --> 10:46.940
Is that what you want?!

10:54.230 --> 10:57.460
Do I look like a man who 
would despise such things?

10:58.530 --> 11:01.870
Don't think you know me!
I would gladly welcome that!

11:02.970 --> 11:05.970
<b>Fire Force</b>

11:02.970 --> 11:05.970
<b>Chapter 3</b>

11:05.970 --> 11:08.980
<b>Fire Force</b>

11:05.970 --> 11:08.980
<b>Chapter 3</b>

11:16.400 --> 11:19.690
Then I'll keep showing you 
until you're satisfied!

11:19.690 --> 11:21.730
I'm going to become a hero!

11:22.170 --> 11:26.120
I promised. I will protect 
my mother and Sho.

11:26.810 --> 11:30.450
I will protect Sho and the 8th—my family.

11:31.160 --> 11:35.250
To do that... I will knock 
down both this world and God!

11:36.410 --> 11:37.880
Is something wrong?

11:38.730 --> 11:39.730
Captain?

11:41.100 --> 11:44.380
Something came and caused 
interference with my universe.

11:44.380 --> 11:45.810
An Adolla Link?

11:46.850 --> 11:48.050
Sho!

11:54.230 --> 11:57.370
Who is that? This warm feeling...

11:57.830 --> 12:01.780
You, who interfered with my universe.
Who are you?

12:05.050 --> 12:06.050
Older brother?

12:07.540 --> 12:10.680
<i>By the time I was old enough 
to understand things,</i>

12:10.680 --> 12:15.210
<i>I'd lost my family,
lost everything dear to me.</i>

12:17.080 --> 12:21.410
<i>That's why, for me, there are no 
low-value or high-value lives.</i>

12:21.900 --> 12:23.820
<i>Everyone's lives are important.</i>

12:24.520 --> 12:28.420
<i>I want to become a hero who saves everyone.</i>

12:29.200 --> 12:31.440
<i>Even now, that hasn't changed.</i>

12:31.750 --> 12:32.650
<i>But...</i>

12:33.390 --> 12:37.430
<i>there are precious lives that I 
have to protect, no matter what.</i>

12:38.000 --> 12:40.030
<i>I'm close to overheating.</i>

12:47.510 --> 12:50.330
<i>Death's weight is pressing down on me hard.</i>

12:53.550 --> 12:56.190
Blue flames.

12:56.190 --> 13:00.140
Hotter, more powerful flames 
than his usual ones.

13:03.260 --> 13:06.550
<b>Death's Weight</b>

13:06.550 --> 13:10.620
<i>Captain Burns' heat continues 
to rise even now.</i>

13:11.430 --> 13:13.220
<i>I won't have many chances.</i>

13:18.600 --> 13:20.390
Voltage Nova.

13:25.420 --> 13:26.660
Stage IV!

13:28.060 --> 13:31.330
I'm giving it everything I've got!

13:30.200 --> 13:30.530
<b>Death's Weight</b>

13:35.250 --> 13:38.290
I swore I would pray.

13:38.690 --> 13:42.440
To simply pray. To become a servant of God.

13:42.810 --> 13:45.260
I swore to become this empire's lion...

13:45.650 --> 13:47.180
and expel devils!

13:54.390 --> 13:59.020
Is that all you've got, Devil?
What of your feelings about heroes?

13:59.020 --> 14:02.330
Is this all you amount to, Shinra?!

14:02.870 --> 14:05.070
God desires destruction.

14:05.520 --> 14:07.400
I am God's servant.

14:07.980 --> 14:10.280
I simply follow that path!

14:11.480 --> 14:14.430
If you would call that raising 
the banner of rebellion,

14:14.430 --> 14:17.160
then I shall fight against 
everything in existence!

14:17.160 --> 14:20.990
You can't even beat one old man,
you ridiculous upstart!

14:20.990 --> 14:24.540
No matter who I'm up against, 
no one can stop my kick!

14:24.540 --> 14:27.860
Not you, Captain Burns! Not even God!

14:41.270 --> 14:43.520
Voltage Nova!

14:58.310 --> 15:01.570
<i>I'm getting... torn away!</i>

15:02.640 --> 15:05.390
The Evangelist is the voice of this world.

15:05.390 --> 15:06.800
In other words, God!

15:07.210 --> 15:10.930
This world is headed into ruin!
I heard it myself!

15:10.930 --> 15:14.310
Damn it! I will never...

15:14.310 --> 15:20.400
Even if the world tries to burn everything 
to the ground, I will never see it as right!

15:20.940 --> 15:24.620
Because that would mean Sho and Mom...

15:26.520 --> 15:28.020
Big Brother?

15:28.020 --> 15:30.290
<i>You don't have to worry.</i>

15:30.910 --> 15:32.910
<i>Just be good and wait there, got it?</i>

15:33.360 --> 15:35.320
<i>I swear I'll save you.</i>

15:47.020 --> 15:48.290
Shinra...

15:48.620 --> 15:51.890
He's accelerating from that position?

15:52.760 --> 15:55.750
Then show me that you can 
blow everything away!

16:01.450 --> 16:04.480
Once I accelerate, no one can stop me!

16:04.480 --> 16:07.770
No matter what kind of conflagration 
this world tries to start...

16:12.290 --> 16:14.170
my feet...

16:15.610 --> 16:17.700
will send it all flying!

16:45.930 --> 16:48.420
Sweat? Right.

16:48.940 --> 16:51.870
I've been sweating, haven't I?

16:52.360 --> 16:56.440
Being in that insane heat 
made my sweat vaporize.

17:11.690 --> 17:13.600
Captain Burns.

17:22.580 --> 17:27.510
The fires of the world are big, Shinra.

17:29.810 --> 17:32.730
But it is the young people who carry hope.

17:34.550 --> 17:37.080
Will you acknowledge me a little now?

17:37.400 --> 17:41.860
You've pushed me this far, 
so a little more than before.

17:46.710 --> 17:48.630
You've grown stronger.

17:49.660 --> 17:53.190
Why didn't you dodge my attacks even once?

17:53.190 --> 17:58.800
Shinra, young people like you 
are this world's resistance.

17:59.310 --> 18:02.880
As an old man, all I can do is 
accept what you send my way.

18:06.140 --> 18:09.330
It really is such a cumbersome way to live.

18:10.030 --> 18:12.570
You said the Evangelist is 
the voice of this world.

18:14.880 --> 18:16.420
If this world—

18:16.860 --> 18:21.170
if God—is trying to turn 
toward destruction,

18:21.170 --> 18:24.830
then all an old geezer 
like me can do is obey.

18:25.200 --> 18:29.540
This eye of mine that I left 
in the past can see only ruin.

18:30.890 --> 18:32.360
Show me you can change it,

18:32.760 --> 18:36.520
and grow stronger than this world.

18:41.310 --> 18:42.430
It's coming.

18:42.430 --> 18:43.650
Yeah.

18:44.480 --> 18:47.260
A new Pillar has been born.

18:48.520 --> 18:49.600
An Adolla Link.

19:08.650 --> 19:11.650
A Demon Infernal? And one of its eyes is...

19:12.360 --> 19:13.890
A doppelganger?

19:21.730 --> 19:24.560
People equal dust.

19:25.550 --> 19:28.020
Return to the dust whence you came.

19:28.340 --> 19:29.900
D-Dragon is...

19:33.270 --> 19:35.020
I'll stop it. Please stand back!

19:35.020 --> 19:37.020
What can a mere human do?

19:37.020 --> 19:37.740
Maki!

19:43.240 --> 19:45.870
<i>What? This...</i>

19:46.200 --> 19:47.720
<i>will kill me.</i>

19:47.720 --> 19:50.330
<i>I can't block it.</i>

20:10.640 --> 20:11.970
Blown away, were they?

20:14.750 --> 20:15.890
What?

20:15.890 --> 20:17.410
We're alive?

20:18.360 --> 20:19.830
Maki, are you hurt?

20:19.830 --> 20:22.420
That was amazing, Maki-san! You blocked it!

20:22.420 --> 20:25.910
What? I thought we didn't stand a chance.

20:27.840 --> 20:30.000
Was that divine Grace?

20:32.370 --> 20:36.170
They're safe! That's Maki-san for you!

20:41.950 --> 20:43.590
Captain Burns, that's—

20:43.590 --> 20:44.540
Stay back!

20:44.540 --> 20:48.980
I told you not to interfere, Haumea.

20:52.430 --> 20:53.710
Captain Burns!

20:53.710 --> 20:56.880
Shinra! Remember why you came here!

20:56.880 --> 20:57.860
But—

20:57.860 --> 21:00.260
We don't know how long Obi will last.

21:02.610 --> 21:04.630
Run, Shinra.

21:05.220 --> 21:07.710
52, I leave the rest to you!

21:08.580 --> 21:12.100
Go, Shinra!

21:12.100 --> 21:14.110
Don't look back! Let's go.

21:13.610 --> 21:14.860
But we can't...

21:25.200 --> 21:26.490
<i>Pray.</i>

21:27.580 --> 21:31.070
<i>My prayers asked for nothing...</i>

21:32.420 --> 21:35.680
<i>but here at the end, I beg of you.</i>

21:41.940 --> 21:44.000
That went well.

21:45.040 --> 21:49.330
Thank you for your excellent hard work,
my friends from the 8th!

21:49.330 --> 21:51.150
Now, let's see...

21:51.150 --> 21:53.180
I'll leave it to you.

21:53.180 --> 21:54.120
Understood.

21:54.450 --> 21:57.830
We have no more need of them. 
Kill everyone but the Pillar.

21:59.540 --> 22:01.030
I'll be the rear guard!

22:01.030 --> 22:03.500
We'll rescue Captain Obi and 
leave as fast as we can!

22:03.870 --> 22:05.960
This is the end of the 8th, isn't it?

22:06.930 --> 22:10.700
How incredibly tenacious! 
They're going to survive?

22:10.700 --> 22:14.470
There's no chance of survival. 
Being tenacious won't be enough.

22:20.060 --> 22:22.700
Wh-Who are you?

22:22.700 --> 22:23.360
Faint.

22:23.360 --> 22:25.200
Hey you! Hold on a—

22:25.200 --> 22:26.890
Wait, that's wrong.

22:26.890 --> 22:28.660
Just a moment!

22:29.060 --> 22:31.350
I am Moonlite Mask.

22:31.880 --> 22:34.490
Gambling and fighting are how I show...

22:35.270 --> 22:36.330
love.

22:37.000 --> 22:42.000
<b>To Be Continued</b>

24:11.930 --> 24:13.430
<b>Fire Force Chapter 3</b>

24:12.370 --> 24:14.310
Just a moment!

24:13.430 --> 24:14.760
<b>Next Time</b>

24:14.310 --> 24:16.900
I am Moonlite Mask.

24:16.000 --> 24:17.280
What is that?

24:17.280 --> 24:18.440
Moonlight?

24:17.720 --> 24:19.320
Benimaru from the 7th, huh?

24:18.440 --> 24:20.230
Captain Shinmon!

24:19.620 --> 24:22.070
I am Moonlite Mask.

24:22.060 --> 24:26.930
<b>Episode 7</b>

24:22.060 --> 24:26.930
<b>Sleeping Truth</b>

24:22.070 --> 24:23.910
Next time, "Sleeping Truth."

24:23.910 --> 24:26.700
Return to the great flame of fire. Látom.
